      "id": "P001",
      "kind": "intro",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "text": "This is Working Draft's audio overview of the Impeachment Trial of Vice President Sara Duterte for July 14, 2026. It is a working reference, not an official Senate record.",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The bottom line",
      "text": "The session completed Attorney Jeremy Lotoc's testimony. The defense continued its cross-examination, the prosecution conducted redirect, and the defense returned for recross before the court excused the witness.",
