    {
      "id": "P003",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The central distinction",
      "text": "The central distinction was between proving that words were spoken and proving that the events described were true. Lotoc said he could confirm that the Vice President uttered the recorded statements, but he had no personal knowledge of the underlying circumstances.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00186",
          "start_seconds": 1940.94,
          "clock": "00:32:20",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00247",
          "start_seconds": 2556.64,
          "clock": "00:42:36",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "What the recordings contained",
      "text": "A November 23 recording included the Vice President saying she had instructed an unnamed person to kill the President, the First Lady, and the former speaker if she were killed, followed by the recorded statement that the person agreed. A November 26 recording included her explanation that she had asked a person to take revenge if she died.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00215",
          "start_seconds": 2273.1,
          "clock": "00:37:53",
          "speaker_name": "Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00217",
          "start_seconds": 2296.43,
          "clock": "00:38:16",
          "speaker_name": "Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00218",
          "start_seconds": 2303.5,
          "clock": "00:38:23",
          "speaker_name": "Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00706",
          "start_seconds": 6207.5,
          "clock": "01:43:27",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Mark C. Vinluan"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S01776",
          "start_seconds": 14116.17,
          "clock": "03:55:16",
          "speaker_name": "Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte"
        },
        {
