    {
      "id": "P008",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The unnamed person",
      "text": "Lotoc said the Cybercrime Division believed an unnamed person existed because of the November 23 and November 26 statements. When asked whether the division had any other basis, he said it did not, as far as his division was concerned.",
      "citations": [
