          "clock": "03:09:05",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P010",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "What the court did",
      "text": "Early in cross-examination, the court sustained a competency objection and limited Lotoc to the fact and tenor of the recorded statements, not their truth. Later, it denied a defense motion to strike Lotoc's interpretation and left the weight of that answer to the senator-judges.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00155",
          "start_seconds": 1550.35,
          "clock": "00:25:50",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S01995",
          "start_seconds": 15605.07,
          "clock": "04:20:05",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P011",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "A caution from the chair",
      "text": "Before Lotoc was excused, the Presiding Officer clarified that admission against interest is an exception to the hearsay rule and should not automatically be treated as a confession. The chair separately reserved conclusions of fact and law to the Impeachment Court.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S02389",
          "start_seconds": 18656.4,
          "clock": "05:10:56",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00879",
          "start_seconds": 7197.05,
          "clock": "01:59:57",
          "speaker_name": "Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P012",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Two witnesses withdrawn",
      "text": "After Lotoc's testimony, the prosecution announced that it would no longer call Attorney Zuleika Lopez or Captain Belinda Bello. It called Lopez's proposed authentication testimony unnecessary because the defense had used the same video, and described Bello's proposed testimony as corroborative.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S02494",
          "start_seconds": 19738.39,
          "clock": "05:28:58",
          "speaker_name": "Atty. Lorna Patajo-Kapunan"
        },
        {
